# AlertsDLX PHP

- Namespace: `DLXPlugins\AlertsDLX`. Autoload maps to `php/` via Composer (`lib/`).
- Follow WordPress PHP Coding Standards (`phpcs.xml.dist`: WordPress-Core + WordPress-Docs).
- End every code comment with a period.
- Prefer helpers in `php/Functions.php` and allowlists/sanitizers in `php/Options.php`.
- Option key is `alerts_dlx`. Do not invent a second options store without migration.
- Headline tags and theme slugs must stay allowlisted (`Options::resolve_headline_tag`, `get_allowed_block_styles`).
- Admin AJAX and REST callbacks need capability checks and nonces / permission callbacks.
- After PHP edits, run PHPCS / the project PHP beautifier when available.
- Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` before structural changes.
